# Nothing here is needed to build the amicu-server image (Rust workspace
# under crates/, root Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, and the committed .sqlx/ offline
# query cache are the only inputs cargo-chef/cargo actually touch) - keeping
# the build context small also keeps cargo-chef's cache layer stable across
# unrelated edits (web/docs changes must not bust the dependency-cook layer).

.git/
.github/

# Rust build output - never ship the host's target/ into the image or the
# build context; the multi-stage build produces its own.
target/
**/target/

# Not part of the Cargo workspace (members = ["crates/*"] only).
web/
node_modules/
sdk/
tools/

# Local dev tooling / docs / misc, irrelevant to the container build.
docker/
docker-compose.yml
docs/
ops/
.turbo/
# Claude Code worktrees/state (can be GBs of nested checkouts + target/)
.claude/
*.log

.DS_Store
**/*.DS_Store
